## Goal
See how the six samples in this project cluster: a principal component analysis (PCA) on the
gene-level counts, with each sample coloured by its `condition` (untreated: A1, A2, A3;
treated: B1, B2, B3). The analysis produces the plot and the numbers behind it. It does not
test for differential expression or decide whether the samples separate by condition.

